  <AltText>
    Sprite of our headmate, Hsiao Lyuhsien. Zhe is a cat-dragon hybrid with purple fur, dark purple scales, dark purple hair, and pink eyes. It has two cat ears that are the same colour as the fur, and two dragon horns. Zher tail is purple with dark purple scales running down its length. It is wearing a purple dress with a purple and faded blue sash, and a translucent purple skirt. Zhe is also wearing arm and leg warmers, which are the colours of the transgender and genderfluid flags.
  </AltText>
